exercise: An uncle is {F-c} years older than {a}, and {a} is {c}. How many years will pass before the uncle is {k.words} times as old as {a}?
exercise: {a} is {c} years old, and {a.his} coach is {F}. In how many years will the coach's age be {k} times {a.his} age?
exercise: A father in Toronto is {F} years old, and his child {b} is {c}. How many years must go by before the father is {k.words} times as old as {b}?
