test: A teacher in Dublin is {F}, and one of her pupils is {c}. How many years from now will the teacher be {k.words} times as old as the pupil?
test: {b} turns {c} today. {b.His} father is {F-c} years older. In how many years will the father's age be {k} times {b}'s age?
test: {a} is {c}, {a.his} sister is {c+z}, and their mother is {F}. In how many years will the mother be {k.words} times as old as {a}?
test: How many years from now will a {F}-year-old mother be {k} times as old as her {c}-year-old child?
test: The difference between the ages of {b} and {b.his} aunt is {F-c} years. {b} is {c} now. In how many years will the aunt be {k.words} times as old as {b}?
